    59	#: Codex renders tool activity live in its TUI but only writes it to the rollout at completion.
    60	#: For Codex (attach), we scrape the tmux pane for these lines so tool bubbles appear LIVE —
    61	#: matching Claude Code (which logs tool_use to its transcript immediately). Claude needs no scrape.
    62	_TUI_VERBS = {"Read": "📄", "List": "📂", "Search": "🔎", "Ran": "🛠️",
    63	              "Edit": "✏️", "Wrote": "✏️", "Added": "✏️", "Updated": "✏️",
